Hello friends, the new [b]SHAPESHOOTER[/b] update - Ver. 1.01 is now available!

[b]Here's what changed:[/b]
[list][*]Changed the artstile on the Planet selection menu to fit more the game artstyle;
[*]Checkpoints reviewed and new added in every stage;
[*]AI improved for the circle enemies;
[*]Improved the turret control to work better with analog controller, (it was limited to 8 directions, and now it's completely free);
[*]Added a slider to change the turret rotation speed;
[*]Mouse now are locked inside the game screen;
[*]New mouse recticle;
[*]Improved the navigation through the menus and prompt shown;
[*]Stage selection screen info and Player's gears position;
[*]Game time counter only works during the gameplay;
[*]Little bug are not shown after the endgame;
[/list]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1143900/Shapeshooter/
[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/7243354/820d0d4bf093d055102d05a9a4d50ec76b74e1a6.gif[/img]

If you played the game and enjoyed, please leave a brief steam review, it helps a lot for a small developer.

As always, thank you very much for all of the support. 

Paulo Brunassi

Hello friends, i've been working a lot on the last few days to fix all the reported bugs and balancing the game, and this update fix most of it, here's a list of everything done:

[list]

[*] Fixed a bug that makes the game crash when restarting a level with the tower deployer "open";
[*] Fixed the bug that doesn't let you take screenshots here on Steam;
[*] Fixed the bug that make the game crash by the end of some levels;
[*] Fixed balancing issues on levels: 4, 6, 15, 17, 20, 23 and 27;
[*] Changed life and speed of enemies on the third world;
[*] Fixed issues on the 25 and 50 specials achievements;
[*] Fixed some saving issues that the game doesn's store enemies destroyed;

Please if you had beaten the game and lost your save on the previeous update and don't want to replay the game, please send a e-mail to support@nukgames.com before 02/28 and I will send you a save file with the game beaten, and all achievements. 

[/list]

