Hello friends, after a while working on other 2 games I tought is time for a HUGE update for Rock 'N' Roll Defense! And the version 2.0 is ready to go! Here's the list of everything that has bem updated!

[list]
[*] 240 New Achievements that can be used on your steam profile;
[*] The speakers now attack the leader of a wave and not the closer enemy (the most reported issue from the players)
[*] Fixed collision issues;
[*]Changed all sound effects of the speakers (now all sounds is from a real drum)
[*]Changed the behavior of the Omni speaker (now it aims for an enemy);
[*]Changed the damage that the Omni speaker does;
[*]The Freezer speaker now does a little damage;
[*]Changed the behavior of the deploier "mines";
[*]Fixed a bug when the deployer place a mine out of the lane;
[*]Changed the damage from the mines;
[*]Changed the way that the game saves your progress to a more reliable file (unfortunely the game will have to be restarted)
[*]Difficult balanced (I'm replaying through the whole game again and more changes can be made, please leave your feedback regarding this item)/
[*]Changed the compression of the tracks without quality lost, the game now have less than 100MB (against 312MB from the older version)
[*]Changed the color and size of the money increase and decrease money they are more clear on the screen now
[/list]

I really hope that you guys enjoy the game, and if possible leave a review on steam! That helps a LOT for a solo indie dev like myself.

Thank you very much for all the support!

Paulo Brunassi

