Hello friend, this isn't in fact the 6th update, I updated some times in the past weeks without posting a news, but this time I find important to share with you guys and show what I'm working with:

- Fixed the bug with the music that sometimes kept repeating;

- Improved performance a lot, for this I had to add a 2 seconds load screen;

- Fixed the constant crashes that some players was experiencing;

- Now the game saves the configuration;

- Now the game saves the selected speakers;

- A lot of smaller fixes;

For the next big update I've been working on the final 20 levels and achievements, and should be up soon. If you still have any problems with the game, please report on the bugs thread on the community hub.

Best Regards, 
Paulo ːskull_winkː

