It's been about 20 days since the last update, and now I focused more on bug fixes, optimization, and balancing. Here's something that has been done:

[list]
    [*]Unneeded textures removed, and all the others resized for a performance gain on CPU and video memory (30% on video memory) without visible change;
    [*]All enemies has been balanced (life and speed);
    [*]Stages balanced;
    [*]Fixed the bug when upgrading the speakers when there's two bases close to each other;
[/list]

For futures updates here's what I'm working:

[list]
    [*]Ram improvement;
    [*]Trading cards;
    [*]New speakers and a speaker selection screen;
[/list]

I created a new [url=steamcommunity.com/app/438480/discussions/0/365163686059947570/] thread[/url] on the forum, so we can discuss about this update. 

If you liked the game, please post a review here on steam, that helps a LOT a small game as RnrD.

Thank you very much!

