It's been a little more than 20 days from the release of Rock 'N' Roll Defense, and I'm happy to announce the first big update, and to celebrate we're running a 25% off discount!

[h1]NEW FEATURES[/h1]
- Soundtrack and Deluxe edition;
- 1 World (Let's take out a cowntry show);
- 10 new stages;
- 5 new country themed enemies (1 new boss);
- 6 new songs;
- Added screenshake when a enemy reach the stages;

[h1]CORRECTIONS e Updates[/h1]
- Every shockwave completely remade for a more vivid appearance;
- Colision mask and logic remade for a better precision;
- Omni speaker shockwave remade (now it emits 2, 3 or 4 independent shockwaves depending on the level);
- Shockwaves reach corrected
- Continue options on menu only works if the game locate a save file;
- Corrected bug that makes an enemy don't take damage when receive a shot;
- New colors for the first stage;

As aways thank you guys!

